                                                        &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;mt-2 m=
y-3 text-primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                     =
                                       &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0=
&quot;&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=
=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;F=
irstly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                     =
                                                   printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A         =
                                                       &lt;/li&gt;=0A            =
                                                    &lt;li&gt;=0A                =
                                                    &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the pr=
inter to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                      =
                          &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                         =
                       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                             =
                       &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the pri=
nter=0A                                                                    =
    driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                =
    &lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A              =
                                                  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                 =
